{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_8000_situation", "source_sha256": "6ca68b16ae01705b86439f4cf00794bc601cf04ecd0ee2e97cbd5ceafed93d65", "ja": "グラビア撮影のお仕事　撮影前", "zh": "写真拍摄的工作　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_8000_place", "source_sha256": "826a2d3bec0c82ef55302dc7fce83b35ec175d0a8361f076359ee290816a077d", "ja": "原宿", "zh": "原宿", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_8001_p", "source_sha256": "c7dac7d1df403fdacc7c1dc2a498e754c3d193037e7a15ff51cdf723efefb01a", "ja": "（今日はアイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』の撮影。\n昴は『令和ギャル』に扮して、本番に挑む）", "zh": "（今天是偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的拍摄。\n昴将扮成“令和辣妹”，迎接正式拍摄。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_8002_047sub", "source_sha256": "c8f28d42293d8fa947624974b7b12201c8427e748b6362eaa2845492537d4215", "ja": "おつー！　{$P$}！", "zh": "辛苦啦！{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_8003_047sub", "source_sha256": "acad4a16914b9833390018ad55a889349ea129d1b1f425b801f0ff709488cbc0", "ja": "もうすぐ撮影始まんねー！　オレ……じゃなくて\nあーし、チョー楽しみっ！　一緒にアゲてこー☆", "zh": "拍摄马上就要开始啦——！我……不对，\n人家超期待的！一起嗨起来吧～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_8004_p", "source_sha256": "ebeb30e13073212167f4cbb3066222d959fbac41eefdb6ebf7aab9435c3cfdce", "ja": "お、お疲れ様、昴。\nもしかして、今の喋り方は……。", "zh": "辛苦了，昴。\n难道说，你刚才说话的方式是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_8005_047sub", "source_sha256": "0c4c1d168ac5b4353ae52957678648dad5d4a82c70b6c6720331b3f3d3a06ecc", "ja": "へへっ、ビックリした？　兄ちゃんの漫画で\n勉強したんだけど……どうだった？　オレのギャル！", "zh": "嘿嘿，吓了一跳吧？我可是看哥哥的漫画学的……怎么样？我的辣妹风！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_8006_p", "source_sha256": "ef53e42c4551a9ff722eee03186fe3404ce364ae3f938da879bba1b66d0be8fb", "ja": "格好と相まって、すごく可愛かったよ。", "zh": "再加上这身打扮，特别可爱哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_8007_047sub", "source_sha256": "39cbf770aa7bd89e7d0010983308753db35fea8dc62a6fc2436e5e34d758353c", "ja": "よかった～。『ギャル』って言われても、\nオレよくわかんなくてさー。ちょっと心配だったんだ。", "zh": "太好了～。就算被说是“辣妹”，\n我也搞不太懂嘛。之前还有点担心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_8008_047sub", "source_sha256": "f4cb6608b36168d391e105bbe267ac0dc90e69d321e4bad7e9c2bc8ffab6a358", "ja": "……今更だけど、何で{$P$}は、\nオレにギャルの衣装を着させようって思ったんだ？", "zh": "……虽然现在才问，但{$P$}为什么会想让我穿辣妹风格的服装啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_8009", "source_sha256": "47fb87fea685ff4a35c39b25d41fb2ee266f02aefed6ed16440270ffb010e1d7", "ja": "相性の良さ", "zh": "契合度", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_8010", "source_sha256": "c38541b19d24a7c06e275f8ec61b2ad2a6cf01d024c0b726dde182563212c42f", "ja": "普通に可愛い", "zh": "普通可爱", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_8011", "source_sha256": "277a4ecae0c669bbc25a67dc1084528f8152ba2f4132b1d9ccc6e5cec89aea3e", "ja": "ギャップ", "zh": "反差", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_8100_p", "source_sha256": "61d40bd18c5539cb397fd88997a329eebab9e498127d7b88715e8b842f238b65", "ja": "昴の明るくて前向きなところが、ギャルの精神……\nギャルマインドと、相性がいいと思ったんだ。", "zh": "昴那开朗积极的一面，我觉得和辣妹的精神……\n辣妹精神很合拍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_8101_047sub", "source_sha256": "edf20509837e61797a04af928416929b1eb9c894d94750d47ea02272009e1abe", "ja": "ギャルマインド……そっかぁ、へへっ♪\nそう言われたら、確かに近いところがあるかも。", "zh": "辣妹精神……这样啊，嘿嘿♪\n你这么一说，好像确实有相似的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_8102_047sub", "source_sha256": "5a2f01078877c0ac6f82cc2b5affdcd9d5824793f17bfb9741805e639a6ac9af", "ja": "ってことは、あんまり役作りとかしない方がいいよな。\nありがと、自信出てきたよ！", "zh": "这么说来，没必要太刻意地去塑造角色了吧。\n谢谢，我越来越有自信了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_8200_p", "source_sha256": "111e353308ef97295ada6739dab858df12f0b6d3ecdeecdcc7f1f8bf2b54b0fb", "ja": "昴が着たら可愛いと思ったんだ。それにファンの人達も\n昴がギャルになったら気になると思って。", "zh": "我觉得昴穿上会很可爱。而且粉丝们应该也会很好奇昴变成辣妹是什么样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_8201_047sub", "source_sha256": "740af7d8308b025abb95bce20d336fc0f2425431d9167ca305a16069d660107c", "ja": "そ、そうかな？　いつものオレとはちょっと違うけど\n……まあ、気になる人がいるなら期待に応えないと！", "zh": "是、是吗？虽然和我平时的样子有点不一样……不过，既然有人感兴趣，那就得回应他们的期待才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_8202_047sub", "source_sha256": "9d9c8344e4ced23fa00ad34a63e20ff27d9a7fd9b06fe5c6e4aaadf743abb4b4", "ja": "オレの全力で、ギャルやってやるぜ！\n最高の写真にするから、楽しみにしててくれよな♪", "zh": "我要使出全力来当辣妹！  \n我会拍出最棒的照片，你就期待着吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_8300_p", "source_sha256": "8550e2fe0a0c6f47944d04f67701c23ec08e91c651ad1816394d0fc582c715df", "ja": "ギャルじゃない昴が、ギャルをやるギャップが\n面白いし、その姿を見てみたいと思ったんだ。", "zh": "不是辣妹的昴要扮辣妹，这种反差很有意思，所以我想看看那个样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_8301_047sub", "source_sha256": "885b3957068b97e892446800869277e70cafbbdacf2adb8b741bbc9b90eee1f7", "ja": "なんだよそれー！　単に好みってこと？\nそれなら別に、オレじゃなくてもいいよな？", "zh": "那是什么啊——！说白了就是你的喜好吗？\n既然这样，那换成别人也无所谓吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_8302_047sub", "source_sha256": "d8fd1c5b7b1fc66af5ff24d47493a2937d9a6c53aaca8de5c59210a3273051fc", "ja": "{$P$}の見る目は信用してるけど……\nうーん、とにかくやってみるよ。", "zh": "我虽然相信{$P$}看人的眼光……\n唔——总之我先试试看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
